    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/1394fc7749d832319dd5457979dca6a2.avif?t=1754589889\" width=640 height=360 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Cat is a 2D Idle Roguelike Survivor. Place up to 3 vampire cats on the map, face waves of enemies and bosses in random maps. Collect loot (blue diamonds, purple orbs, artifacts), level up, improve your cats, your wheel, and survive as long as possible! How far will you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/afa81a196e1e8a3e12804d5cae713aa9.avif?t=1754589889\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE &amp; BECOME SUPER POWERFUL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect blue diamonds and fill the progress bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/d784a3a01512addc2917081057f51391.avif?t=1754589889\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT BOSSES &amp; WIN PURPLE ORBS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/3fc8688e9d0f634b323fc11573452a24.avif?t=1754589889\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK CATS, WHEELS &amp; ARTIFACTS</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/1394fc7749d832319dd5457979dca6a2.avif?t=1754589889\" width=640 height=360 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Cat is a 2D Idle Roguelike Survivor. Place up to 3 vampire cats on the map, face waves of enemies and bosses in random maps. Collect loot (blue diamonds, purple orbs, artifacts), level up, improve your cats, your wheel, and survive as long as possible! How far will you go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/afa81a196e1e8a3e12804d5cae713aa9.avif?t=1754589889\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE &amp; BECOME SUPER POWERFUL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect blue diamonds and fill the progress bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/d784a3a01512addc2917081057f51391.avif?t=1754589889\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT BOSSES &amp; WIN PURPLE ORBS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505650/extras/3fc8688e9d0f634b323fc11573452a24.avif?t=1754589889\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK CATS, WHEELS &amp; ARTIFACTS</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "VampireCat is a 2D idle roguelike-survivor where you play as up to three vampire cats. Choose their unique attacks, face waves of enemies and bosses, collect diamonds and orbs, upgrade your cats and your wheel, and survive as long as possible.",
